### Internal preparation material ###
#
# The demonstration script and the defence notes are rehearsal material for the
# team, not submitted deliverables. They are kept out of the repository because
# it is shared with the course instructor. Both remain on disk and are built
# with: docs/report/build.ps1 -IncludeInternal
docs/report/demonstration-script.tex
docs/report/defence-notes.tex
docs/HomeSense-Demonstration-Script.pdf
docs/HomeSense-Defence-Notes.pdf
